rossing, traffic signals, pedestrian etiquette, hazard awareness, and responsible behavior in realistic virtual road environments.\n\nThrough scenario-based VR simulations, children can observe traffic, make decisions, and learn from their actions in a safe and controlled environment. The application turns conventional safety education into an engaging and memorable learning experience while allowing students to practice real-world situations without physical risk.\n\nSafe Steps demonstrates the use of immersive technology for meaningful educational and social impact, helping schools introduce practical road-safety awareness in an engaging and technology-driven format.", "short_description": "Virtual Reality Application for Traffic Safety Education in Indian School Going Children, Safe Steps uses immersive VR to teach kids road-crossing behaviour, pedestrian etiquette, and traffic-rule awareness turning safety education into an engaging, memorable experience rather than a one-time lecture."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://safesteps.info/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yogeshwar Navandar", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://safesteps.info/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1467218869797325"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLI